<div class="text zkb-component zkb-component--text"><div class="t-richtext l-max-width l-max-width--apple " data-component-is="text" data-component-id="text" data-analytics-component-name="Text">
    
    <h4>&nbsp;</h4>
<h4>Ms Schnydrig, you have been more visible beyond the cantonal and national borders with the Private Banking division for around two years now. What is the background to this?</h4>
<p>We would like to raise awareness of our Private Banking services at ZKB in Switzerland and, since we have the simplified exemption, also in Germany. We offer our clients an integral value chain that takes into account all aspects relevant to their assets. This offer is in great demand – even outside our canton.</p>
<h4>Where are you active?</h4>
<p>We operate from Zurich throughout Switzerland and in selected markets abroad – primarily in Europe. We also look after Swiss nationals living abroad, provided the country is not on our restricted list. Prudent risk management and the preservation of our excellent reputation are top priorities in all our activities.</p>
<h4>What is your goal?</h4>
<p>As a reliable financial partner, we want to offer our clients excellent advice that is close to their life situation, reflects their individual values and allows them to benefit from our excellent internal and external network. In line with our range of services, we strive to continuously diversify ZKB’s income base in the Private Banking business unit in order to ensure continuity and stability.</p>

</div>


    

